+# N26 conditional Dev/controller preparation protocol v1
+
+This authorizes isolated CPU preparation only, before any N26 online outcomes. N25 remains the active frozen GPU7 Dev cohort. If N25 promotes, prioritize its independently prepared validation and leave N26 inactive. No live source integration, budget amendment, native GPU proof, episode, model/API/simulator invocation or protected data access is released here. Root adoption later requires actual root-reviewed N25 terminal disposition, source/runtime/compute/capacity review and a separate exact release.
+
+## Fixed science and comparison
+
+Freeze scientific commit8fd01eb77e2e83a100e54b21dc955c34bda9a3cc, root CPU review SHA ad2c38db5be770aca23e834e08814f2d1b3e13e87666ad5a8b35a8a19c8791b1. N26 changes only the input source for initial and rollout clipped RBF from noisy_sample to the same unmodified model_output_sample_v1. N25 math, profile other than that one option, sample-only runtime gate, versioned N26 telemetry and bounded witness source semantics stay frozen. Report concrete integration conflicts before changing scientific source or prior validated behavior.
+
+Prepare matched primary Dev task-major0..9 x C0,Q0,N25,N26,40cells. Use the exact existing frozen Dev task/seed/init-state mapping, deriving it from plan metadata without reading outcomes. Keep720steps/20Hz/8actions/pop16/10rounds/176canonical/11score batches; model/scheduler/RBF schedules unchanged (nominal21forwards/19RBF for full guided searches). Preserve fixed current-account codex_cli/chatgpt, gpt-6-astra/low/E2/180s, runtime/cache/perception/Stage prompts and action semantics. No Poe or alternate account/provider fallback, credentials access, fresh guidance generation or cache-miss fallback. Different guided lengths/telemetry/audit time are charged and reported.
+
+Promote only all40valid accepted cells, N26>=5/10 and>=each C0/Q0/N25, substantive QD/ED and all source/identity/native/cost/data/action gates PASS. Numeric futility only after a whole four-arm task when N26wins+(10-completed_tasks)<5. Valid zero gradients and low mechanism activity are legitimate outcomes, not invalidity or retry conditions. No arbitrary early outcome cutoff. At most2 exact sole-Codex-timeout whole-episode recoveries, at most1 per cell,42 maximum attempts including failed originals. Reuse unchanged E2 classifier; no retry of valid failures, arithmetic/algorithm errors or partial-cohort resume. Preserve every failed cost and denominator.
+
+## Native audit and proof preparation
+
+Layer N26-specific scalar/witness checks on unchanged prior base cost/actuator-quality evidence. C0/Q0 controls remain their prior paths; N25 control retains original N25 scalar schema and independent native RBF checks. N26 must require its new schema/source/clean-input/sample/no-Jacobian tags and reject missing, downgraded or cross-profile witnesses. Never relabel N26 payloads as N25 to bypass validation. Shared independent numerical reference may be reused through exact-source binding, but input-source semantics require additional N26 proof and independent comparisons. Do not import the production gradient helper as the expected-value oracle.
+
+Audit all-call phase/iteration/timestep/decision/count/native dtype/finite/clipping/zero summaries. For only the predefined <=11 first-guided witnesses, independently reconstruct native arithmetic and require exact uint8 input_xyz==model_output_before, then projected geometry, gradients, norm and original masked scale20 addition. Preserve same-call16origin association, <=20KiB numeric/call, <=220KiB/episode, <=16KiB metadata/call, first-active slots, reset and no-backfill. No full latent dump, shadow gradient, extra real model or simulator branch. Later calls have scalar consistency only. Operand is not rounded output delta. Strict zero-guided paths must agree across compute, metrics absence and native report.
+
+Prepare a disabled tensor-only backend proof using the separately frozen independent-arithmetic-protocol-v1.md in this variant: one future metered GPU7 resource process, maximum60s active+40s cleanup,0episodes/model/API/simulator, no automatic retry. Physical proof must be independently rooted, same native backend, and bound to actual UUID/boot/PID/source/runtime before Dev admission. Existing N23 quality and N25 RBF proofs may be reused for unchanged N25 control mathematics only via exact-source bridges; neither certifies N26 input wiring. CPU fixtures cannot substitute for physical proof.
+
+## Resource and authority bounds
+
+Preparation does not change current494attempt/100GPUh cumulative caps or buckets55baseline/199development/180validation/40formal/20recovery, or protected cumulative validation32h/formal12h. Later finite budget adoption, if needed, is a separate root decision with exact bytes, preserved history and actual capacity; do not invent a higher cap in templates. Final local Dev GPUh cap is frozen once at adoption, no larger than min(22, actual unprotected remaining hours), and each dispatch needs full1800+40s local and cumulative unprotected room. Native proof cost, cleanup, audit time and invalid attempts are charged through original private ledgers. No free attempt or GPU time.
+
+New N26 audit/contract/bridge/prepare/supervise/report/recovery/preflight modules are allowed, along with minimal closed explicit runner/worker routes. Preserve existing C0/Q0/N23/N25 behavior/source through documented reverse-insertion bridges and synthetic tests. Record every changed function. Original science frozen above must remain byte-equivalent. Source closure includes all new controller/audit files. Admission requires terminal root-reviewed N25, successful actual N26 proof and settled historical control proofs, exact source/runtime/worker/budget-authority/release identities, GPU7 exclusive availability and private isolation. One owned GPU worker only.
+
+Disabled templates must remain executable=false/authorization=false, no actual prior outcomes/proofs/receipts pulled into this CPU phase. Keep immutable ordered journals, terminal result and cohort ledger snapshot. Handle engineering/postprocessing failures as INVALID/incomplete with costs; no silent resume or failure conversion to valid rejection. Controller output must be under this N26 variant, native attempts under the existing frozen artifact root. Do not open protected validation/formal or create their launchers. If later N26 promotes, separately freeze fresh matched60validation C0/Q0/N26 with >=10/20>=controls and original acceptance/ablation gates.
+
+## CPU delivery
+
+Continue in N26/implementation, commit both protocols before implementation. CPU2 with CUDA hidden/uninitialized, synthetic fixtures only and guarded no network, real worker/process dispatch, model/API/GPU/simulator or actual attempt/native/Stage/protected/credential reads. Read source and plan structure only; no real predecessor result is needed to test schemas. Exact prior proof/result identities remain placeholders until root adoption. Do not touch W, live state/ledgers/tree/checkpoint/budgets/plans or active supervisor.
+
+Meaningful tests cover both native candidate/control gates, clean-input byte tampering and wrong mode, source/runtime/identity/UUID/process/worker/ref/path/symlink/authority refusal, bounded witness schedule/caps/reset/origin association, zero-guided accounting, preflight failure admission, exact timeout typed recovery including one-per-cell limits, immutable partial/futile/promoted/invalid terminal reconstruction, budget/protected reserves, and no protected dispatch. Preserve logs and fixes, rerun only affected tests after changes. Deliver clean commit, full source manifest/reverse bridge, concrete independent proof cases/reference, disabled templates, controller contract and tests with limitations. No online score or release implied.
