+# N26 independent clean-output native arithmetic protocol v1
+
+Frozen before any native run; this document authorizes CPU preparation only. A separately released one-shot GPU7 tensor process may later execute maximum60s+40s cleanup with0episodes/model/API/simulator. No retry or empirical tolerance repair is authorized by this document.
+
+Use the six existing deterministic dyadic N25 cases strict_interior, exact_boundary, mixed_saturation, distinct_saturated, coincident_saturated, coincident_interior; two native dtypes FP32/BF16 and three fixed full16x64x128 input layouts: contiguous stride8192/128/1; transpose-backed stride8192/1/64; model-like (16,67,128) contiguous backing sliced to last64 rows, stride8576/128/1 and storage_offset384. Thus36fixed positive cases, no outcome-based case selection or random tuning. The clean sample is the tested input. Use a separately defined unequal noisy tensor to detect incorrect source selection. The full clean tensor is only synthetic, never a production serialized witness.
+
+The input-selection path must return the identical clean output object with its layout; sample config is required, absent/epsilon/v-prediction negative controls reject. Shared production clipped geometry uses its unchanged detach-leaf chain. Independently reconstruct the same declared mathematical chain without calling production helper/clip/projector as the oracle: strict-interior derivative1 inside(-1,1),0 at bounds/outside; first8xyz39/40/41; candidate-wise seven-action gather; original16 fixed pre-cast origins and native conversion; .01 multiplication/cumsum/start row; squared pairwise distances, sqrt(+1e-6), reciprocal(+1e-6), diagonal mask.float and sum; full-shape gradient norm.item threshold1e-8 then division(norm+1e-8). Preserve dtype/operation order and account explicitly for gradient layout. An independent reference may construct equivalent synthetic strides; do not claim layout equivalence without the actual native comparison. If a sound layout reconstruction cannot be expressed from bounded witness metadata, report that gap before extending collection or changing source.
+
+Require native contiguous uint8 equality including signed zero for cast origins, projected xyz, raw/normalized gradient and update operand, and exact normalization scalar. On this candidate model_output_before must be the clean input xyz, unlike N25's arbitrary separate before fixture. Require byte identity input_xyz==model_output_before before applying original negative scale20 in-place update, then exact independently computed model_output_after. Distinguish intended operand from rounded subtraction delta. Strict interior additionally matches independent original absolute RBF; exact-boundary/saturated gradient coordinates are zero, coincident and fully saturated zero outcomes legal. Validate finite handling, wrong horizon/source/binding rejection, one fixed nextafter finite-element corruption, signed-zero corruption and no extra origin/projector reads or full production latent capture.
+
+Expected values cannot call production RBF. Existing unchanged independent N25 reference is usable only when its layout assumptions are explicitly established by these native tests; any new reference must be frozen and reviewed before GPU execution. Actual episode audit is in the same charged worker on its native backend and only first-guided bounded witnesses; no external tensor reread/replay process. Existing control proofs remain historical exact-source evidence, not new candidate proof. Source/runtime/GPU/boot/PID/resource ledger and elapsed cleanup-inclusive cost must bind the physical proof. All failures remain evidence and block Dev; CPU pass alone never admits a GPU episode.
